      "items": [
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "She must be very happy, for she smiles all the time."
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "While I was out, it rained for a while."
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "He drinks black coffee while she prefers it with cream."
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "While there are problems, we can do it."
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "He had lunch on the plane."
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "What do you do on Sunday(s)?"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "He was on his way home."
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "I want to buy a book on international relations."
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Which side are you on?"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "He lived in a town on the coast."
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "On my arriving home, I discovered the burglary."
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "They were in the U.S. at the time."
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "He works at the head office."
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Let's meet at two."
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "At night, you can see stars."
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "She is a genius at architecture."
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "I used to major in architecture but I dropped it for I was not good at it."
        }
      ]
